@api = https://localhost:7119

### Seed 2000 finished redemptions for C-100
POST {{api}}/dev/seed-redemptions?customerId=C-100&count=2000

### Catalog: Merch, page 1
GET {{api}}/rewards?category=Merch&page=1&pageSize=10

### Catalog: search
GET {{api}}/rewards?search=Reward&pageSize=10

### Redemptions, first page
# @name first
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/redemptions?limit=5

### Next page with the cursor
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/redemptions?limit=5&cursor={{first.response.body.$.nextCursor}}

### Only cancelled
GET {{api}}/customers/C-100/redemptions?status=Cancelled&limit=5